    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/3.2.15"&gt;3.2.15&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;connection stability&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fully-down connection group throws RedisConnectionException (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5466746870" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3223" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3223/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3223"&gt;#3223&lt;/a&gt;) by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5466970943" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3224" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3224/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3224"&gt;#3224&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SwitchPrimary retires the servers its rebuild drops by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5473441715" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3225" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3225/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3225"&gt;#3225&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make fallback discovery and keep-alive probes cluster-slot aware by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/HarnageaGabriel/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/HarnageaGabriel"&gt;@HarnageaGabriel&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5185834743" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3185" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3185/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3185"&gt;#3185&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix Sentinel connection leak and AbortOnConnectFail=false handling by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/HarnageaGabriel/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/HarnageaGabriel"&gt;@HarnageaGabriel&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5185912409" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3187" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3187/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3187"&gt;#3187&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix a vacuous cluster-probe assertion, and pin the first-handshake residue by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5474675457" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3226" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3226/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3226"&gt;#3226&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A tracer redirect proves liveness, so it completes the handshake by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5475445901" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3227" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3227/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3227"&gt;#3227&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dial a cluster node before waiting for it to connect by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5486434731" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3238" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3238/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3238"&gt;#3238&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;fixes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compare strings against blobs without decoding them into a string by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5478749817" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3228" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3228/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3228"&gt;#3228&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Add RedisValue.EqualityComparer, with an opt-in binary reading by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5480436530" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3230" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3230/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3230"&gt;#3230&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IServer.Execute supplies the default database rather than refusing the command by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5486080593" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3237" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3237/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3237"&gt;#3237&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;background / engineering&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI: resolve the NuGet cache key once, so the post step never walks the tree by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5483375452" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3231" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3231/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3231"&gt;#3231&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Close the test-suite gaps from &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5485485277" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3234" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3234/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3234"&gt;#3234&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5485789636" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3235" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3235/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3235"&gt;#3235&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Point the obsolete messages at 4.0, since 3.2 has shipped without them by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5488666688" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3244" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3244/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3244"&gt;#3244&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drop explicit Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub reference by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5462769691" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3222" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3222/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3222"&gt;#3222&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Changelog&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;a class="commit-link" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/compare/3.2.1...3.2.15"&gt;&lt;tt&gt;3.2.1...3.2.15&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
